00:58:04.046 --> 00:58:08.240
So, if you want to, if
you absolutely loved this,

00:58:08.240 --> 00:58:10.656
if this was riveting to you.

00:58:10.656 --> 00:58:12.314
I mean, I know you're on
the edge of your seat, like

00:58:12.314 --> 00:58:13.814
what can I do now?

